  "description": "Version-36 two-stage training across 2500, 5000, 7500, and 10000 pedestrians. Every active-policy episode starts with two shelters and installs eight equal-capacity shelters at t=15,30,...,120, then evolves through t=180. The first six four-episode rollout updates supervise only the shared GNN/LSTM environment-dynamics representation from the real 15-minute transitions. The remaining updates train the actor with PPO and full-action clean NMCC using the exact immediate pre/post change in remaining hazard-weighted time-to-safety. No candidate is censored by benefit or safety rank, and there is no correction gate, model-filled action value, heuristic continuation, or fallback controller.",
